  "remarks": "Fargona Kimyo Zavodi LLC is an Uzbek company producing cotton pulp. The company supplies the Perm Powder Plant and the Kazan State-Owned Gunpowder Plant with cotton pulp, which those entities have used to manufacture weapons for the Russian Armed Forces. Fargona Kimyo Zavodi LLC is controlled by Rustam Muminov. Therefore, Fargona Kimyo Zavodi LLC is supporting Russia’s military and industrial complex by being involved in the supply of military technology and equipment. Moreover, Fargona Kimyo Zavodi LLC is associated with Rustam Muminov.",
